{"3512950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monterey Jack", "steam_appid": 3512950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/14acaaa2fcea1222b89b8ddee2668677.avif?t=1783442057\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> is a game where you're trapped in a cheese factory. Your best friend is missing. And a giant cheese man wants you dead. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILLY WONKA MEETS HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drip, drop, the dairy's near, Monterey Jack is what you fear!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> hunts you in real-time. Stay alert, watch your noise meter and follow his cheesy footprints, or risk getting caught off guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO CUT THE CHEESE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jack is not alone. His army of cheese zombies must be chopped into bits!</i> <i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTRUN, OUTSMART, AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>Enemies have detailed hitboxes, requiring players to find weak spots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>makeshift weapons</strong> such as <strong>slingshots, nail guns, and kitchen knives</strong> to fight a large cast of cheese-born baddies. Enemies react based on where they are hit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MASSIVE CHEESE FACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Travel the cheese river to explore the cheese factory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Monterey Jack</strong> is packed with <strong>terrifying encounters, intense chases, and heart-stopping jump scares.</strong> The game features <strong>multiple endings</strong>, and a<strong> survival mode</strong>: where players have to run from Jack for as long as t